; ..\src\BaseSw\Infra\Ssw\TC37A\Tricore\Ifx_Ssw_Infra.h	   256   *   This API will service Watchdog functionality corresponding to CPU WDT Hardware module.
; ..\src\BaseSw\Infra\Ssw\TC37A\Tricore\Ifx_Ssw_Infra.h	   257   *   User need to use this API call periodically. This API results in reloading of the Watchdog Timer.
; ..\src\BaseSw\Infra\Ssw\TC37A\Tricore\Ifx_Ssw_Infra.h	   258   *   User need to have the password stored locally in the caller function, (use Ifx_Ssw_getCpuWatchdogPassword).
